OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F353A1787680134
OL,3,CTeenage swimmer delays opening A-Level
OL,4,Cresults to win European gold
OL,6,FJersey is still basking in golden
OL,7,Fglory as swimming sensation Filip
OL,8,FNowacki continues his winning streak,
OL,9,Fhaving been crowned European champion
OL,10,Fin Paris.
OL,12,FThe 18-year-old fought off fierce
OL,13,Fcompetition in the Men's 200m
OL,14,FBreaststroke Final at the European
OL,15,FAquatics Championships.
OL,17,FHe clinched the win in the final
OL,18,Fseconds, narrowly beating Dutch Caspar
OL,19,FCorbeau by 0.08 seconds.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
