PN,35302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F353A1787680134
OL,3,CTeenage swimmer delays opening A-Level
OL,4,Cresults to win European gold
OL,6,FThe suspense continues as he opens his
OL,7,FA-level results, after delaying them
OL,8,Ffor the race.
OL,10,F"I think if it's not the way I want it
OL,11,Fto go, it almost balances itself out
OL,12,Fwith what's just happened in the pool,
OL,13,Fbut fingers crossed I make it into
OL,14,Funi," Filip told Aquatics UK after his
OL,15,Fwin.
OL,17,FFollowing his win, Filip said: "It's
OL,18,Fsomething I'm definitely going to have
OL,19,Fto do a lot of reflecting on."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,354,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F353A1787680134
OL,3,CTeenage swimmer delays opening A-Level
OL,4,Cresults to win European gold
OL,6,F"I knew the lads were going to take
OL,7,Foff very fast, and my strength is
OL,8,Falmost bringing it back, so I almost
OL,9,Fhad to let them go out like during
OL,10,Ftheir race plan and go out fast.
OL,12,F"I had to make sure that I was within
OL,13,Falmost fighting distance with 100
OL,14,Fmetres to go, 50 to go, but I could
OL,15,Fsense Caspar pulling away every wall,
OL,16,Fso I was almost playing catch-up every
OL,17,Fsingle length."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
