CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F353A1787680134
OL,3,CTeenage swimmer delays opening A-Level
OL,4,Cresults to win European gold
OL,6,FMike Barber, Head of Sixth Form at
OL,7,FMillfield School where Filip studies,
OL,8,Fdescribed the teenage swimmer as a
OL,9,F"diligent and hard-working" student.
OL,11,F"It's just a phenomenal achievement,"
OL,12,FMike told ITV News. "I always say that
OL,13,F16 to 18 is probably (the age where)
OL,14,Fthey've got to navigate so much in
OL,15,Fterms of challenging circumstances in
OL,16,Facademics.
OL,26,@uD@VpmuD@dpn
