PN,35305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F353A1787680134
OL,3,CTeenage swimmer delays opening A-Level
OL,4,Cresults to win European gold
OL,6,F"We know how amazing Filip is, so it's
OL,7,Fnot unexpected for us because we see
OL,8,Fit day in and day out from him. It
OL,9,Fjust speaks to his dedication, his
OL,10,Fdrive, and ambition that he's been
OL,11,Fable to achieve so much.
OL,13,F"This has been a real breakthrough
OL,14,Fyear for him in 2025, and it's great
OL,15,Ffor us to see him getting the
OL,16,Frecognition, but also achieving what
OL,17,Fwe've seen for a long time."
